# Dhan broker credentials — OPTIONAL.
# The screener runs fully on NSE bhavcopy WITHOUT this. Fill it in only if you
# want Dhan as a data source (--source dhan), live intraday LTP, or order exec.
#
# How to get these (one-time, ~2 min):
#   1. Open a free Dhan account: https://dhan.co  (needs the mobile app / web login)
#   2. Go to  https://web.dhan.co  ->  Profile / DhanHQ Trading APIs  ->  "Access DhanHQ APIs"
#   3. Generate an access token. It is valid for 30 DAYS (no daily TOTP login),
#      which is why this broker suits an unattended daily job.
#   4. Copy your Client ID and the token below, then save this file as:
#         data/broker_creds.env      (drop the ".example")
#
# Never commit the real file. Regenerate the token every ~30 days.

DHAN_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
DHAN_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_access_token_here
